@startuml
title Using CoreLAB plugins

autonumber
skinparam monochrome true

box "External Module" #E8F8F5
participant "Plugin\n(DLL/SO)" as Plugin
end box

box "CoreLAB Framework" #FEF9E7
participant "Loader / Main" as Main
participant "FMemPluginDict\n(Available Modules)" as P_Dict
participant "FMemInstanceDict\n(Active Instances)" as I_Dict
end box

actor "User (UI)" as User

== Phase 1: Exporting (Plugin Side) ==
Plugin -> Plugin: 1. Export functions\n(e.g., 'memory_create')

== Phase 2: Initialization & Loading (Main Program) ==
Main -> Main: 2. Search for plugins\n(FindAllFiles)
Main -> Plugin: 3. Link library (LoadLibrary)
Plugin --> Main: Return TLibHandle
Main -> Plugin: 4. Extract addresses\n(GetProcedureAddress)
Plugin --> Main: Return physical memory addresses\n(e.g., FCreate, FDestroy)
Main -> Main: Build TMemPluginItem\n(Descriptor)
Main -> P_Dict: 5. Add to Directory\n(Key: filename)

== Phase 3: Instantiation & Registration ==
User -> Main: Select module to instantiate\n(from PluginList)
Main -> P_Dict: Look up plugin descriptor
Main -> Plugin: 7. Call FCreate()
Plugin --> Main: Return new object instance
Main -> Main: Build TMemInfo\n(Instance + ModuleName)
Main -> I_Dict: 8. Register instance\n(Key: user-defined name)

== Phase 4: Runtime Usage ==
User -> Main: Trigger action (e.g., Reset)
Main -> I_Dict: 9. Retrieve active instance record
I_Dict --> Main: Return TMemInfo
Main -> Main: Execute method\n(MemInfo.Memory.Reset)

== Phase 5: Destruction ==
User -> Main: Select instance to destroy
Main -> I_Dict: 10. Retrieve active instance record
I_Dict --> Main: Return TMemInfo
Main -> P_Dict: Look up descriptor by MemInfo.ModuleName
P_Dict --> Main: Return TMemPluginItem
Main -> Plugin: Call FDestroy(MemInfo.Memory)\n//Free memory in DLL//
Main -> I_Dict: Remove instance by key
Main -> Main: Finalize & clean up

@enduml
